POST /api/posts (Multer 25MB Buffer)
  └─► sharp(buffer).rotate()
        ├─► resize(1200, 1200).webp(85)  ──► uploads/images/*.webp
        └─► resize(400, 400).webp(80)    ──► uploads/thumbs/*.webp
